## Xcode — per-user state
## xcuserdata holds window layout, breakpoints, scheme selection and
## UserInterfaceState.xcuserstate, which rewrites itself on almost every
## interaction with the IDE. None of it belongs to the project.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcuserdatad

